    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on Foxxel's journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winter is coming, and Foxxel needs a hood!</strong> But getting one won't be easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 8 unique settings and conquer 80 challenging levels!</strong> From enchanted forests to dark caves, each environment introduces new puzzles that build upon each other throughout the game, ensuring a constantly innovative experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each scenario brings a fresh challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Push stones to clear paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Connect lasers to the correct braziers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Use reflectors to redirect lasers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more! New mechanics to challenge you. Solve puzzles in the desert, the city, and even the North Pole! \u2744\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Autoplay Available!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a level proves too difficult, watch the step-by-step solution to learn how to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.poster.avif?t=1744028272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.webm?t=1744028272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.mp4?t=1744028272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 Steam achievements</strong> to unlock throughout the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/cb3d34f66555fb32b219d58c38b6307e.poster.avif?t=1744028272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/cb3d34f66555fb32b219d58c38b6307e.webm?t=1744028272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/cb3d34f66555fb32b219d58c38b6307e.mp4?t=1744028272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming pixel art</strong>, with a <strong>lighthearted and comical story</strong>, and a cozy soundtrack to accompany the adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foxxel Quest</strong> is a game that challenges your reasoning and warms your heart! Are you ready for this journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found a translation error? Let us know! We want everyone to play Foxxel Quest. Your language isn't available? Get in touch! We appreciate your support!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on Foxxel's journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winter is coming, and Foxxel needs a hood!</strong> But getting one won't be easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 8 unique settings and conquer 80 challenging levels!</strong> From enchanted forests to dark caves, each environment introduces new puzzles that build upon each other throughout the game, ensuring a constantly innovative experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each scenario brings a fresh challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Push stones to clear paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Connect lasers to the correct braziers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Use reflectors to redirect lasers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more! New mechanics to challenge you. Solve puzzles in the desert, the city, and even the North Pole! \u2744\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Autoplay Available!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a level proves too difficult, watch the step-by-step solution to learn how to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.poster.avif?t=1744028272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.webm?t=1744028272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.mp4?t=1744028272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 Steam achievements</strong> to unlock throughout the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/cb3d34f66555fb32b219d58c38b6307e.poster.avif?t=1744028272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/cb3d34f66555fb32b219d58c38b6307e.webm?t=1744028272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/cb3d34f66555fb32b219d58c38b6307e.mp4?t=1744028272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming pixel art</strong>, with a <strong>lighthearted and comical story</strong>, and a cozy soundtrack to accompany the adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foxxel Quest</strong> is a game that challenges your reasoning and warms your heart! Are you ready for this journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found a translation error? Let us know! We want everyone to play Foxxel Quest. Your language isn't available? Get in touch! We appreciate your support!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Foxxel Quest is a cute and challenging pixel art puzzle game! Help Foxxel find a warm hood while solving 80 unique puzzle levels. Each setting brings a new challenge that builds upon each other throughout the game. With 30 achievements and optional autoplay, it's fun for all ages!",
